      "effect": "2 WATER monsters\nYou can only Special Summon \"Codaedalus(s)\" once per turn. This card's name becomes \"Umi\" while on the field. If this card is Link Summoned: You can activate this effect; during the End Phase of this turn, add 1 card from your GY to your hand that mentions \"Atlantis, City of the Sea Dragon\", except \"Codaedalus\". Once per turn: You can send 1 face-up \"Umi\" you control to the GY; send up to 2 Spells/Traps on the field to the GY.",
      "official": false
    },
